#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to install the development version of the IBM Quantum Compute client."
msgstr "Alamin kung paano i-install ang development version ng IBM Quantum Compute client."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source"
msgstr "I-install ang IBM Quantum Compute client mula sa pinagmulan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client from source {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"
msgstr "I-install ang IBM Quantum Compute client mula sa pinagmulan {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` from source, you can access the current development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr "Kapag nag-install ka ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` mula sa pinagmulan, maaari kang mag-access ng kasalukuyang development version, sa halip na gamitin ang bersyon sa Python Package Index (PyPI) repository. Maaari kang mag-inspect at mag-extend ng pinakabagong bersyon ng code nang mas mahusay.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"
msgstr "Lumikha at i-activate ang bagong virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa iyong project directory at lumikha ng minimal na kapaligiran na may Python lamang na naka-install dito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang iyong bagong kapaligiran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "I-install ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#install-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para i-install ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"
msgstr "I-clone ang `qiskit-ibm-runtime` repository.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa direktoryo ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "I-install ang `qiskit-runtime`. Inirerekumenda naming gumamit ng [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para maiwasan ang polusyon ng iyong global na Python installation.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Karaniwang install**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr "**Editable mode**: Sa mode na ito, hindi mo kailangang muling i-install ang Qiskit kapag may mga pagbabago sa code sa proyekto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ without optimizations.\n"
msgstr "    Sa editable mode, ang mga compiled extension ay binubuo sa _debug mode_ nang walang mga optimization.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer requirements. We recommend using a [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr "(Opsyonal) Kung gusto mong magpatakbo ng mga test o linting check, i-install ang mga developer requirement. Inirerekumenda naming gumamit ng [virtual environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) para maiwasan ang polusyon ng iyong global na Python installation.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"  - Basahin ang [mga alituntunin sa pag-aambag](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) para mag-ambag sa `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [I-install ang Qiskit SDK mula sa pinagmulan](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Subukan ang isang tutorial, tulad ng [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
